orio-helm","content":"`scripts/lamassu-fast-lane.sh`: automatización para levantar dependencias y desplegar Lamassu con intervención mínima"},"339":{"id":"/docs/deployment/self-hosted/overview-84","page_id":"/docs/deployment/self-hosted/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/deployment/self-hosted/overview#softhsm-como-complemento-opcional","content":"El chart `charts/softhsm` no forma parte del despliegue estándar, pero resulta útil en entornos de laboratorio cuando se necesita simular un HSM compatible con PKCS#11. No sustituye al backend KMS principal; sirve como soporte para pruebas o integraciones concretas."},"340":{"id":"/docs/deployment/self-hosted/overview-85","page_id":"/docs/deployment/self-hosted/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/deployment/self-hosted/overview#versionado-y-migraciones","content":"La serie actual del chart principal es `3.7.x`. Para upgrades entre versiones, el repositorio incluye guías específicas en `charts/lamassu/CHANGELOG/`, especialmente en cambios importantes como la adopción de Envoy Gateway o la introducción del servicio KMS."},"341":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/alerts","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/alerts","type":"page","content":"Alertas y suscripciones","breadcrumbs":["Docs","Plataforma","Operar Lamassu"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/platform/pki/alerts"},"342":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/alerts-0","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/alerts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/pki/alerts","content":"Envía eventos de la PKI a personas y sistemas externos."},"343":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/alerts-1","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/alerts","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/platform/pki/alerts#cómo-funciona","content":"Cómo funciona"},"344":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/alerts-2","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/alerts","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/platform/pki/alerts#canales-disponibles","content":"Canales disponibles"},"345":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/alerts-3","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/alerts","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/platform/pki/alerts#crea-una-suscripción","content":"Crea una suscripción"},"346":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/alerts-4","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/alerts","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/platform/pki/alerts#elige-el-evento","content":"Elige el evento"},"347":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/alerts-5","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/alerts","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/platform/pki/alerts#configura-el-destino","content":"Configura el destino"},"348":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/alerts-6","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/alerts","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/platform/pki/alerts#limita-las-notificaciones","content":"Limita las notificaciones"},"349":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/alerts-7","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/alerts","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/platform/pki/alerts#revisa-y-activa","content":"Revisa y activa"},"350":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/alerts-8","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/alerts","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/platform/pki/alerts#gestiona-una-suscripción","content":"Gestiona una suscripción"},"351":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/alerts-9","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/alerts","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/platform/pki/alerts#familias-de-eventos","content":"Familias de eventos"},"352":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/alerts-10","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/alerts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/pki/alerts","content":"Las suscripciones convierten los eventos de Lamassu en notificaciones accionables. Puedes avisar a un equipo, alimentar un sistema de incidentes o activar una automatización cuando cambia una CA, un certificado o un dispositivo."},"353":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/alerts-11","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/alerts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/pki/alerts#cómo-funciona","content":"Un servicio publica un evento de dominio."},"354":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/alerts-12","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/alerts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/pki/alerts#cómo-funciona","content":"Lamassu evalúa las suscripciones asociadas a ese tipo de evento."},"355":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/alerts-13","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/alerts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/pki/alerts#cómo-funciona","content":"El filtro de cada suscripción decide si debe notificarse."},"356":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/alerts-14","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/alerts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/pki/alerts#cómo-funciona","content":"Lamassu entrega el evento al canal configurado."},"357":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/alerts-15","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/alerts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/pki/alerts#cómo-funciona","content":"El inventario de eventos muestra cuándo se observó cada tipo por última vez, cuántas veces ha ocurrido y cuántas suscripciones tiene. Puedes expandir un evento para inspeccionar un ejemplo de su payload JSON antes de crear el filtro."},"358":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/alerts-16","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/alerts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/pki/alerts#canales-disponibles","content":"**Email** envía avisos a una persona o lista operativa. Solo requiere la dirección de destino."},"359":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/alerts-17","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/alerts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/pki/alerts#canales-disponibles","content":"**Microsoft Teams** publica la notificación en un canal mediante su URL de webhook."},"360":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/alerts-18","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/alerts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/pki/alerts#canales-disponibles","content":"**Webhook** entrega el evento a una automatización, SIEM o sistema de incidentes mediante `POST` o `PUT`."},"361":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/alerts-19","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/alerts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/pki/alerts#elige-el-evento","content":"Abre **Alerts**, localiza el tipo de evento y selecciona **Subscribe**. Revisa el último ejemplo JSON para identificar los campos que necesitarás filtrar."},"362":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/alerts-20","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/alerts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/pki/alerts#configura-el-destino","content":"Selecciona Email, Microsoft Teams o Webhook e introduce los datos del canal."},"363":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/alerts-21","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/alerts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/pki/alerts#limita-las-notificaciones","content":"Añade un filtro si no quieres recibir todas las instancias del evento."},"364":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/alerts-22","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/alerts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/pki/alerts#limita-las-notificaciones","content":"**None** notifica todas las instancias del evento."},"365":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/alerts-23","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/alerts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/pki/alerts#limita-las-notificaciones","content":"**JSON Path** evalúa uno o varios campos concretos."},"366":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/alerts-24","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/alerts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/pki/alerts#limita-las-notificaciones","content":"**JSON Schema** acepta únicamente payloads con una estructura determinada."},"367":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/alerts-25","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/alerts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/pki/alerts#limita-las-notificaciones","content":"**JavaScript** permite expresar lógica personalizada."},"368":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/alerts-26","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/alerts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/pki/alerts#limita-las-notificaciones","content":"Por ejemplo, `function (event) { return event.data.status == \"NO_IDENTITY\"; }` limita una suscripción a dispositivos sin identidad."},"369":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/alerts-27","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/alerts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/pki/alerts#revisa-y-activa","content":"Comprueba el evento, el canal y el filtro en el resumen. Selecciona **Confirm Subscription** para comenzar la entrega."},"370":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/alerts-28","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/alerts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/pki/alerts#gestiona-una-suscripción","content":"Abre una suscripción existente para consultar su destino y filtro, modificar la configuración o seleccionar **Unsubscribe**. Elimina las suscripciones que ya no tengan un propietario operativo para evitar entregas ignoradas o endpoints obsoletos."},"371":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/alerts-29","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/alerts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/pki/alerts#familias-de-eventos","content":"**Autoridades:** `ca.create`, `ca.import`, `ca.reissue` y `ca.delete`."},"372":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/alerts-30","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/alerts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/pki/alerts#familias-de-eventos","content":"**Certificados:** `ca.sign.certificate` y `certificate.delete`."},"373":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/alerts-31","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/alerts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/pki/alerts#familias-de-eventos","content":"**Perfiles:** `profile.create`, `profile.update` y `profile.delete`."},"374":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/alerts-32","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/alerts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/pki/alerts#familias-de-eventos","content":"**Enrolamiento:** `dms.create`, `dms.update`, `dms.enroll` y `dms.reenroll`."},"375":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/alerts-33","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/alerts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/pki/alerts#familias-de-eventos","content":"**Dispositivos:** `device.create`, `device.identity.update` y `device.status.update`."},"376":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/alerts-34","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/alerts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/pki/alerts#familias-de-eventos","content":"**Validación:** `va.role.crl.create`."},"377":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/alerts-35","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/alerts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/pki/alerts#familias-de-eventos","content":"**Claves:** `kms.create`, `kms.import`, `kms.sign.message` y `kms.delete`."},"378":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/alerts-36","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/alerts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/pki/alerts#familias-de-eventos","content":"Utiliza el catálogo que muestra la consola como fuente para los tipos disponibles en la versión que tienes desplegada."},"379":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/certificate-authorities","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/certificate-authorities","type":"page","content":"Autoridades de certificación","breadcrumbs":["Docs","Plataforma","Operar Lamassu"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/platform/pki/certificate-authorities"},"380":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/certificate-authorities-0","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/certificate-authorities","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/pki/certificate-authorities","content":"Crea, importa y opera las autoridades que establecen la confianza de tu PKI."},"381":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/certificate-authorities-1","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/certificate-authorities","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/platform/pki/certificate-authorities#elige-un-flujo","content":"Elige un flujo"},"382":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/certificate-authorities-2","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/certificate-authorities","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/platform/pki/certificate-authorities#crea-una-autoridad-nueva","content":"Crea una autoridad nueva"},"383":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/certificate-authorities-3","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/certificate-authorities","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/platform/pki/certificate-authorities#antes-de-empezar","content":"Antes de empezar"},"384":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/certificate-authorities-4","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/certificate-authorities","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/platform/pki/certificate-authorities#abre-el-asistent