ona el motor"},"393":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/certificate-authorities-13","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/certificate-authorities","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/platform/pki/certificate-authorities#carga-el-material","content":"Carga el material"},"394":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/certificate-authorities-14","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/certificate-authorities","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/platform/pki/certificate-authorities#define-la-emisión-predeterminada","content":"Define la emisión predeterminada"},"395":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/certificate-authorities-15","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/certificate-authorities","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/platform/pki/certificate-authorities#verifica-la-importación","content":"Verifica la importación"},"396":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/certificate-authorities-16","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/certificate-authorities","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/platform/pki/certificate-authorities#inspecciona-una-autoridad","content":"Inspecciona una autoridad"},"397":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/certificate-authorities-17","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/certificate-authorities","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/platform/pki/certificate-authorities#emite-certificados","content":"Emite certificados"},"398":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/certificate-authorities-18","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/certificate-authorities","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/platform/pki/certificate-authorities#revoca-una-ca","content":"Revoca una CA"},"399":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/certificate-authorities-19","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/certificate-authorities","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/platform/pki/certificate-authorities#evalúa-el-impacto","content":"Evalúa el impacto"},"400":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/certificate-authorities-20","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/certificate-authorities","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/platform/pki/certificate-authorities#inicia-la-revocación","content":"Inicia la revocación"},"401":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/certificate-authorities-21","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/certificate-authorities","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/platform/pki/certificate-authorities#confirma-la-identidad","content":"Confirma la identidad"},"402":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/certificate-authorities-22","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/certificate-authorities","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/platform/pki/certificate-authorities#comprueba-la-publicación","content":"Comprueba la publicación"},"403":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/certificate-authorities-23","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/certificate-authorities","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/pki/certificate-authorities","content":"Una autoridad de certificación (CA) vincula identidades con claves públicas mediante certificados firmados. En Lamassu puedes crear una jerarquía nueva, utilizar una clave que ya está en el KMS o incorporar una CA externa."},"404":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/certificate-authorities-24","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/certificate-authorities","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/pki/certificate-authorities#elige-un-flujo","content":"**Nueva CA y nueva clave:** crea una raíz de confianza desde cero. Lamassu genera y custodia el par de claves."},"405":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/certificate-authorities-25","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/certificate-authorities","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/pki/certificate-authorities#elige-un-flujo","content":"**Nueva CA desde KMS:** reutiliza una clave que ya está registrada en la plataforma."},"406":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/certificate-authorities-26","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/certificate-authorities","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/pki/certificate-authorities#elige-un-flujo","content":"**Importar CA con clave privada:** incorpora una autoridad externa con la que Lamassu podrá emitir."},"407":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/certificate-authorities-27","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/certificate-authorities","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/pki/certificate-authorities#elige-un-flujo","content":"**Importar solo el certificado:** añade una autoridad para construir cadenas y validar, pero no para emitir."},"408":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/certificate-authorities-28","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/certificate-authorities","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/pki/certificate-authorities#elige-un-flujo","content":"¿Es tu primera vez? Sigue Crea tu primera CA para completar el recorrido mínimo."},"409":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/certificate-authorities-29","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/certificate-authorities","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/pki/certificate-authorities#antes-de-empezar","content":"Decide si la CA será raíz o intermedia."},"410":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/certificate-authorities-30","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/certificate-authorities","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/pki/certificate-authorities#antes-de-empezar","content":"Elige el motor que custodiará la clave."},"411":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/certificate-authorities-31","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/certificate-authorities","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/pki/certificate-authorities#antes-de-empezar","content":"Define una validez superior a la de los certificados que emitirá."},"412":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/certificate-authorities-32","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/certificate-authorities","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/pki/certificate-authorities#antes-de-empezar","content":"Para una CA intermedia, asegúrate de que la CA padre esté activa."},"413":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/certificate-authorities-33","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/certificate-authorities","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/pki/certificate-authorities#abre-el-asistente","content":"En **Certification Authorities**, selecciona **Create New CA** y elige generar un par de claves nuevo."},"414":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/certificate-authorities-34","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/certificate-authorities","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/pki/certificate-authorities#configura-la-clave","content":"Selecciona el motor criptográfico, el algoritmo y el tamaño o curva. Lamassu admite claves RSA y EC según las capacidades del motor."},"415":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/certificate-authorities-35","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/certificate-authorities","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/pki/certificate-authorities#configura-la-clave","content":"Para RSA puedes elegir 1024, 2048, 3072 o 4096 bits. Para EC están disponibles las curvas P-256, P-384 y P-521."},"416":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/certificate-authorities-36","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/certificate-authorities","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/pki/certificate-authorities#elige-el-tipo-de-ca","content":"Selecciona **Root CA** para una autoridad autofirmada o **Intermediate CA** para una autoridad firmada por otra CA. En el segundo caso, elige la CA emisora."},"417":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/certificate-authorities-37","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/certificate-authorities","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/pki/certificate-authorities#define-la-identidad","content":"Introduce un **CA Name** único. Este nombre se convierte en el `Common Name` del certificado. Completa los campos del Distinguished Name que necesite tu política:"},"418":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/certificate-authorities-38","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/certificate-authorities","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/pki/certificate-authorities#define-la-identidad","content":"`C`: código de país ISO 3166-1 de dos letras."},"419":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/certificate-authorities-39","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/certificate-authorities","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/pki/certificate-authorities#define-la-identidad","content":"`ST`: estado o provincia."},"420":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/certificate-authorities-40","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/certificate-authorities","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/pki/certificate-authorities#define-la-identidad","content":"`L`: localidad."},"421":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/certificate-authorities-41","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/certificate-authorities","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/pki/certificate-authorities#define-la-identidad","content":"`O`: organización."},"422":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/certificate-authorities-42","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/certificate-authorities","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/pki/certificate-authorities#define-la-identidad","content":"`OU`: unidad organizativa."},"423":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/certificate-authorities-43","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/certificate-authorities","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/pki/certificate-authorities#define-la-identidad","content":"El identificador interno de la CA se genera automáticamente y no se puede modificar."},"424":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/certificate-authorities-44","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/certificate-authorities","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/pki/certificate-authorities#configura-validez-y-usos","content":"Define **CA Certificate Expiration** y **Default End-Entity Certificate Issuance Expiration**. Puedes expresar una duración (`5y 8w 4d`), seleccionar una fecha o utilizar la fecha máxima permitida."},"425":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/certificate-authorities-45","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/certificate-authorities","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/pki/certificate-authorities#configura-validez-y-usos","content":"Selecciona un perfil de emisión existente o configura los `Key Usage` y `Extended Key Usage` en el formulario. Si no eliges un perfil, Lamassu aplica los usos básicos predeterminados."},"426":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/certificate-authorities-46","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/certificate-authorities","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/pki/certificate-authorities#crea-y-verifica","content":"Confirma el formulario. La CA debe aparecer en el inventario con su certificado PEM, estado, fecha de expiración y relación de certificados emitidos."},"427":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/certificate-authorities-47","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/certificate-authorities","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/pki/certificate-authorities#crea-y-verifica","content":"Una CA no puede emitir certificados que superen su propia fecha de expiración. Deja margen suficiente para renovar o sustituir la autoridad sin interrumpir a los consumidores."},"428":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/certificate-authorities-48","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/certificate-authorities","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/pki/certificate-authorities#utiliza-una-clave-del-kms","content":"Selecciona &#x2A;*Create New CA (Existing Key)** cuando la clave ya esté registrada en Lamassu. El asistente pide primero la clave de soporte y después muestra la misma configuración de tipo, identidad, validez y perfil."},"429":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/certificate-authorities-49","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/certificate-authorities","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/pki/certificate-authorities#utiliza-una-clave-del-kms","content":"Este flujo resulta útil cuando la clave se creó previamente en un HSM, se importó mediante BYOK o debe reutilizarse con una política de custodia concreta."},"430":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/certificate-authorities-50","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/certificate-authorities","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/pki/certificate-authorities#importa-una-ca-externa","content":"La importación conserva una autoridad creada fuera de Lamassu."},"431":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/certificate-authorities-51","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/certificate-authorities","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/pki/certificate-authorities#selecciona-el-motor","content":"Elige el motor que custodiará la clave importada."},"432":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/certificate-authorities-52","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/certificate-authorities","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/pki/certificate-authorities#carga-el-material","content":"Proporciona el certificado de CA y la clave privada en formato PEM. Para una CA subordinada, añade opcionalmente la cadena de validación."},"433":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/certificate-authorities-53","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/certificate-authorities","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/pki/certificate-authorities#define-la-emisión-predeterminada","content":"Configura la validez que recibirán los certificados finales cuando una solicitud no indique otra duración."},"434":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/certificate-authorities-54","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/certificate-authorities","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/pki/certificate-authorities#verifica-la-importación","content":"Lamassu comprueba que el certificado pertenece a una CA y que el material es coherente antes de registrarlo."},"435":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/certificate-authorities-55","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/certificate-authorities","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/pki/certificate-authorities#verifica-la-importación","content":"Si no dispones de la clave privada, importa únicamente el certificado. La autoridad podrá formar parte de cadenas de confianza y procesos de validación, pero no podrá emitir certificados desde Lamassu."},"436":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/certificate-authorities-56","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/certificate-authorities","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/pki/certificate-authorities#inspecciona-una-autoridad","content":"Abre una CA desde el inventario para consultar:"},"437":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/certificate-authorities-57","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/certificate-authorities","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/pki/certificate-authorities#inspecciona-una-autoridad","content":"Estado y periodo de validez."},"438":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/certificate-authorities-58","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/certificate-authorities","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/pki/certificate-authorities#inspecciona-una-autoridad","content":"Certificado y cadena en formato PEM."},"439":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/certificate-authorities-59","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/certificate-authorities","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/pki/certificate-authorities#inspecciona-una-autoridad","content":"Número de certificados activos, expirados y revocados."},"440":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/certificate-authorities-60","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/certificate-authorities","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/pki/certificate-authorities#inspecciona-una-autoridad","content":"Certificados emitidos en **Issued Certificates**."},"441":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/certificate-authorities-61","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/certificate-authorities","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/pki/certificate-authorities#inspecciona-una-autoridad","content":"CRL vinculada a la autoridad."},"442":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/certificate-authorities-62","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/certificate-authorities","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/pki/certificate-authorities#inspecciona-una-autoridad","content":"Metadatos y motor criptográfico asociado."},"443":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/certificate-authorities-63","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/certificate-authorities","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/pki/certificate-authorities#inspecciona-una-autoridad","content":"Puedes filtrar el inventario por nombre, estado y tipo de CA."},"444":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/certificate-authorities-64","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/certificate-authorities","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/pki/certificate-authorities#emite-certificados","content":"Puedes iniciar una emisión desde **Issued Certificates**, desde la acción de una CA o desde el inventario global de certificados."},"445":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/certificate-authorities-65","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/certificate-authorities","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/pki/certificate-authorities#emite-certificados","content":"**Generate Key & CSR in Browser** resulta útil para una operación manual o una prueba rápida. El navegador genera la clave y debes descargarla al finalizar."},"446":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/certificate-authorities-66","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/certificate-authorities","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/pki/certificate-authorities#emite-certificados","content":"**Upload Existing CSR** es la opción adecuada cuando la clave debe permanecer en el sistema de destino. Lamassu recibe la solicitud, pero nunca la clave privada."},"447":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/certificate-authorities-67","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/certificate-authorities","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/pki/certificate-authorities#emite-certificados","content":"Sigue Emite tu primer certificado para el flujo guiado. La gestión de certificados explica el inventario, la inspección y la revocación."},"448":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/certificate-authorities-68","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/certificate-authorities","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/pki/certificate-authorities#revoca-una-ca","content":"Revocar una CA invalida la confianza en los certificados que ha emitido y puede interrumpir dispositivos y servicios. La acción es irreversible."},"449":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/certificate-authorities-69","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/certificate-authorities","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/pki/certificate-authorities#evalúa-el-impacto","content":"Identifica los certificados, dispositivos y consumidores que dependen de la CA. Prepara una autoridad y una cadena de sustitución cuando sea necesario."},"450":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/certificate-authorities-70","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/certificate-authorities","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/pki/certificate-authorities#inicia-la-revocación","content":"Abre la autoridad y selecciona **Revoke CA**. Elige la razón que describa el incidente, por ejemplo `KeyCompromise`, `CACompromise`, `Superseded` o `CessationOfOperation`."},"451":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/certificate-authorities-71","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/certificate-authorities","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/pki/certificate-authorities#confirma-la-identidad","content":"Escribe exactamente el nombre de la CA para habilitar **Confirm Revocation**."},"452":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/certificate-authorities-72","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/certificate-authorities","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/pki/certificate-authorities#comprueba-la-publicación","content":"El estado debe cambiar a **REVOKED** y la CRL debe reflejar la nueva información. La CA deja de poder emitir certificados."},"453":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/certificate-authorities-73","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/certificate-authorities","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/pki/certificate-authorities#comprueba-la-publicación","content":"La eliminación permanente solo está disponible después de revocar. Elimina el registro únicamente cuando la política de retención y auditoría lo permita."},"454":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/certificate-validation","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/certificate-validation","type":"page","content":"Validación de certificados","breadcrumbs":["Docs","Plataforma","Operar Lamassu"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/platform/pki/certificate-validation"},"455":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/certificate-validation-0","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/certificate-validation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/pki/certificate-validation","content":"Publica el estado de las identidades mediante OCSP y CRL."},"456":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/certificate-validation-1","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/certificate-validation","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/platform/pki/certificate-validation#elige-un-mecanismo","content":"Elige un mecanismo"},"457":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/certificate-validation-2","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/certificate-validation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/pki/certificate-validation","content":"La emisión demuestra quién firmó un certificado; la validación permite saber si todavía debe aceptarse. Lamassu publica el estado mediante dos mecanismos complementarios."},"458":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/certificate-validation-3","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/certificate-validation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/pki/certificate-validation#elige-un-mecanismo","content":"Usa **OCSP** cuando el consumidor esté conectado y necesite consultar el estado más reciente de un certificado concreto."},"459":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/certificate-validation-4","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/certificate-validation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/pki/certificate-validation#elige-un-mecanismo","content":"Usa una **CRL** cuando la validación deba realizarse localmente, sin conexión o sobre un volumen elevado de certificados. El consumidor descarga periódicamente una lista firmada y la conserva hasta la siguiente actualización."},"460":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/certificate-validation-5","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/certificate-validation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/pki/certificate-validation#elige-un-mecanismo","content":"Muchos entornos utilizan ambos: OCSP como comprobación primaria y CRL como mecanismo local o de respaldo."},"461":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/certificate-validation-6","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/certificate-validation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/pki/certificate-validation#elige-un-mecanismo","content":"<Card title=\"Validación online con OCSP\" description=\"Consulta estados Good, Revoked y Unknown en tiempo real.\" href=\"/docs/platform/pki/ocsp\" />"},"462":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/certificate-validation-7","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/certificate-validation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/pki/certificate-validation#elige-un-mecanismo","content":"<Card title=\"Listas de revocación\" description=\"Genera, publica y distribuye CRLs por autoridad.\" href=\"/docs/platform/pki/crl\" />"},"463":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/certificates","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/certificates","type":"page","content":"Certificados","breadcrumbs":["Docs","Plataforma","Operar Lamassu"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/platform/pki/certificates"},"464":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/certificates-0","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/certificates","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/pki/certificates","content":"Consulta, descarga y revoca los certificados emitidos por Lamassu."},"465":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/certificates-1","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/certificates","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/platform/pki/certificates#busca-un-certificado","content":"Busca un certificado"},"466":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/certificates-2","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/certificates","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/platform/pki/certificates#descarga-el-certificado","content":"Descarga el certificado"},"467":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/certificates-3","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/certificates","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/platform/pki/certificates#revoca-un-certificado","content":"Revoca un certificado"},"468":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/certificates-4","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/certificates","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/platform/pki/certificates#abre-la-acción","content":"Abre la acción"},"469":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/certificates-5","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/certificates","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/platform/pki/certificates#elige-una-razón","content":"Elige una razón"},"470":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/certificates-6","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/certificates","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/platform/pki/certificates#confirma-y-verifica","content":"Confirma y verifica"},"471":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/certificates-7","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/certificates","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/platform/pki/certificates#continúa","content":"Continúa"},"472":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/certificates-8","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/certificates","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/pki/certificates","content":"El inventario de certificados ofrece una vista global de las identidades emitidas por todas las autoridades. También puedes abrir **Issued Certificates** dentro de una CA para limitar la vista a ese emisor."},"473":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/certificates-9","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/certificates","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/pki/certificates#busca-un-certificado","content":"Abre **Certificates** y filtra por:"},"474":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/certificates-10","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/certificates","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/pki/certificates#busca-un-certificado","content":"`Common Name` del sujeto."},"475":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/certificates-11","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/certificates","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/pki/certificates#busca-un-certificado","content":"Número de serie."},"476":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/certificates-12","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/certificates","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/pki/certificates#busca-un-certificado","content":"Estado."},"477":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/certificates-13","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/certificates","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/pki/certificates#busca-un-certificado","content":"Autoridad emisora."},"478":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/certificates-14","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/certificates","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/pki/certificates#busca-un-certificado","content":"Utiliza **Quick Inspect** para una comprobación rápida o **View Details** para ver el sujeto, SANs, usos, cadena, periodo de validez y metadatos completos."},"479":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/certificates-15","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/certificates","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/pki/certificates#descarga-el-certificado","content":"La acción de descarga entrega el certificado en formato PEM. Si el certificado se emitió mediante un CSR externo, la clave privada permanece en el sistema que generó ese CSR. Si se generó en el navegador, la clave solo estuvo disponible al finalizar la emisión."},"480":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/certificates-16","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/certificates","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/pki/certificates#revoca-un-certificado","content":"Revoca una identidad cuando la clave se haya comprometido, el sujeto ya no esté autorizado o el certificado deba dejar de aceptarse antes de expirar."},"481":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/certificates-17","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/certificates","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/pki/certificates#abre-la-acción","content":"En el inventario o la vista de detalle, selecciona **Revoke Certificate**."},"482":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/certificates-18","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/certificates","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/pki/certificates#elige-una-razón","content":"Selecciona la razón que represente el incidente. Esta información se publica en OCSP y en la CRL."},"483":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/certificates-19","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/certificates","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/pki/certificates#confirma-y-verifica","content":"Confirma la operación y comprueba que el estado sea **Revoked**. Si la CA regenera la CRL al revocar, verifica también que exista una versión nueva."},"484":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/certificates-20","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/certificates","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/pki/certificates#confirma-y-verifica","content":"Una revocación con la razón `CertificateHold` puede reactivarse. Las demás razones producen una revocación definitiva."},"485":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/certificates-21","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/certificates","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/pki/certificates#continúa","content":"<Card title=\"Validar con OCSP\" description=\"Consulta el estado de un certificado en tiempo real.\" href=\"/docs/platform/pki/ocsp\" />"},"486":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/certificates-22","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/certificates","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/pki/certificates#continúa","content":"<Card title=\"Distribuir una CRL\" description=\"Publica el estado para validación offline.\" href=\"/docs/platform/pki/crl\" />"},"487":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/concepts/architecture","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/concepts/architecture","type":"page","content":"Arquitectura de la plataforma","breadcrumbs":["Docs","Plataforma","Conceptos"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/platform/pki/concepts/architecture"},"488":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/concepts/architecture-0","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/concepts/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/pki/concepts/architecture","content":"Componentes de Lamassu y relación entre control, claves, emisión y dispositivos."},"489":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/concepts/architecture-1","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/concepts/architecture","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/platform/pki/concepts/architecture#plano-de-control","content":"Plano de control"},"490":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/concepts/architecture-2","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/concepts/architecture","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/platform/pki/concepts/architecture#custodia-y-operaciones-criptográficas","content":"Custodia y operaciones criptográficas"},"491":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/concepts/architecture-3","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/concepts/architecture","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/platform/pki/concepts/architecture#emisión-y-enrolamiento","content":"Emisión y enrolamiento"},"492":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/concepts/architecture-4","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/concepts/architecture","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/platform/pki/concepts/architecture#estado-y-validación","content":"Estado y validación"},"493":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/concepts/architecture-5","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/concepts/architecture","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/platform/pki/concepts/architecture#dependencias-de-la-plataforma","content":"Dependencias de la plataforma"},"494":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/concepts/architecture-6","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/concepts/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/pki/concepts/architecture","content":"Lamassu se despliega como un conjunto de servicios independientes. La separación evita que todos los componentes necesiten acceso directo a las claves privadas y permite escalar cada capacidad según la carga."},"495":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/concepts/architecture-7","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/concepts/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/pki/concepts/architecture#plano-de-control","content":"La consola y las APIs administran autoridades, certificados, DMS, dispositivos, alertas y configuración. Los eventos de dominio permiten que conectores y automatizaciones reaccionen a los cambios sin sondear continuamente la plataforma."},"496":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/concepts/architecture-8","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/concepts/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/pki/concepts/architecture#custodia-y-operaciones-criptográficas","content":"El KMS ofrece una interfaz común sobre motores software, PKCS#11 y proveedores cloud. El motor seleccionado conserva la clave o delega la operación criptográfica sin que los demás servicios conozcan su implementación."},"497":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/concepts/architecture-9","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/concepts/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/pki/concepts/architecture#emisión-y-enrolamiento","content":"El servicio de CA emite certificados y mantiene la relación con su autoridad. El DMS aplica las reglas de enrolamiento y expone los flujos EST para que un dispositivo solicite o renueve una identidad."},"498":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/concepts/architecture-10","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/concepts/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/pki/concepts/architecture#estado-y-validación","content":"Device Manager conserva la vista operativa del dispositivo y su historial. Validation Authority publica OCSP y CRLs para que otros sistemas decidan si deben confiar en un certificado presentado."},"499":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/concepts/architecture-11","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/concepts/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/pki/concepts/architecture#dependencias-de-la-plataforma","content":"En un despliegue autogestionado, Lamassu utiliza PostgreSQL para persistencia, RabbitMQ para mensajería y un proveedor OIDC para autenticación. Consulta la arquitectura de despliegue para ver cómo se publican los servicios en Kubernetes."},"500":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/concepts/certificate-lifecycle","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/concepts/certificate-lifecycle","type":"page","content":"Ciclo de vida de una identidad","breadcrumbs":["Docs","Plataforma","Conceptos"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/platform/pki/concepts/certificate-lifecycle"},"501":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/concepts/certificate-lifecycle-0","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/concepts/certificate-lifecycle","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/pki/concepts/certificate-lifecycle","content":"Estados, transiciones y decisiones operativas de un certificado de dispositivo."},"502":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/concepts/certificate-lifecycle-1","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/concepts/certificate-lifecycle","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/platform/pki/concepts/certificate-lifecycle#estados-principales","content":"Estados principales"},"503":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/concepts/certificate-lifecycle-2","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/concepts/certificate-lifecycle","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/platform/pki/concepts/certificate-lifecycle#renovación-y-revocación-no-son-equivalentes","content":"Renovación y revocación no son equivalentes"},"504":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/concepts/certificate-lifecycle-3","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/concepts/certificate-lifecycle","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/platform/pki/concepts/certificate-lifecycle#observabilidad","content":"Observabilidad"},"505":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/concepts/certificate-lifecycle-4","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/concepts/certificate-lifecycle","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/pki/concepts/certificate-lifecycle","content":"Una identidad no termina cuando se emite el certificado. Lamassu mantiene su relación con el dispositivo y registra los cambios necesarios para renovarla, suspenderla o retirarla."},"506":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/concepts/certificate-lifecycle-5","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/concepts/certificate-lifecycle","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/pki/concepts/certificate-lifecycle#estados-principales","content":"**`No Identity`**: el dispositivo está registrado pero no tiene certificado. Debes enrolarlo o asignarle una identidad."},"507":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/concepts/certificate-lifecycle-6","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/concepts/certificate-lifecycle","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/pki/concepts/certificate-lifecycle#estados-principales","content":"**`Active`**: el certificado está vigente y puede utilizarse. Monitoriza su validez y prepara la renovación."},"508":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/concepts/certificate-lifecycle-7","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/concepts/certificate-lifecycle","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/pki/concepts/certificate-lifecycle#estados-principales","content":"**`Renewal Pending`**: la identidad ha entrado en la ventana de renovación. El dispositivo ya puede iniciar el re-enrolamiento."},"509":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/concepts/certificate-lifecycle-8","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/concepts/certificate-lifecycle","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/pki/concepts/certificate-lifecycle#estados-principales","content":"**`Expiring Soon`**: la fecha de expiración está próxima y la renovación requiere atención prioritaria."},"510":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/concepts/certificate-lifecycle-9","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/concepts/certificate-lifecycle","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/pki/concepts/certificate-lifecycle#estados-principales","content":"**`Expired`**: el certificado ha superado su validez. Emite una identidad nueva."},"511":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/concepts/certificate-lifecycle-10","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/concepts/certificate-lifecycle","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/pki/concepts/certificate-lifecycle#estados-principales","content":"**`Revoked`**: el certificado se ha invalidado antes de expirar. Investiga la causa y sustitúyelo si procede."},"512":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/concepts/certificate-lifecycle-11","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/concepts/certificate-lifecycle","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/pki/concepts/certificate-lifecycle#estados-principales","content":"**`Decommissioned`**: el dispositivo se ha retirado definitivamente y no debe volver a enrolarse."},"513":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/concepts/certificate-lifecycle-12","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/concepts/certificate-lifecycle","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/pki/concepts/certificate-lifecycle#renovación-y-revocación-no-son-equivalentes","content":"La **renovación** sustituye una identidad que sigue siendo fiable antes de que expire. La **revocación** comunica que un certificado ya no debe aceptarse. Revoca cuando exista compromiso, retirada o un cambio que invalide la identidad; renueva para mantener la continuidad operativa."},"514":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/concepts/certificate-lifecycle-13","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/concepts/certificate-lifecycle","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/pki/concepts/certificate-lifecycle#renovación-y-revocación-no-son-equivalentes","content":"Dar de baja un dispositivo revoca sus certificados y le impide obtener nuevas identidades. Utiliza esta acción únicamente cuando el dispositivo se retire de forma permanente."},"515":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/concepts/certificate-lifecycle-14","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/concepts/certificate-lifecycle","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/pki/concepts/certificate-lifecycle#observabilidad","content":"El historial de certificados muestra todas las identidades asociadas a un dispositivo. La línea de tiempo registra enrolamientos, renovaciones y cambios de estado. Las suscripciones permiten enviar estos eventos a correo, Microsoft Teams o webhooks."},"516":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/concepts/overview","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/concepts/overview","type":"page","content":"Cómo funciona Lamassu","breadcrumbs":["Docs","Plataforma","Conceptos"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/platform/pki/concepts/overview"},"517":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/concepts/overview-0","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/concepts/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/pki/concepts/overview","content":"El modelo mental de confianza, claves, certificados y dispositivos."},"518":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/concepts/overview-1","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/concepts/overview","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/platform/pki/concepts/overview#el-modelo-en-cinco-piezas","content":"El modelo en cinco piezas"},"519":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/concepts/overview-2","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/concepts/overview","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/platform/pki/concepts/overview#del-alta-a-la-operación","content":"Del alta a la operación"},"520":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/concepts/overview-3","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/concepts/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/pki/concepts/overview","content":"Lamassu conecta tres elementos: una **raíz de confianza**, una **política de emisión** y una **entidad que necesita demostrar su identidad**. La plataforma coordina esos elementos durante todo el ciclo de vida del certificado."},"521":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/concepts/overview-4","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/concepts/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/pki/concepts/overview#el-modelo-en-cinco-piezas","content":"**Motor criptográfico.** Genera o custodia claves y ejecuta las operaciones privadas sin exponer el material criptográfico al resto de servicios."},"522":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/concepts/overview-5","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/concepts/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/pki/concepts/overview#el-modelo-en-cinco-piezas","content":"**Autoridad de certificación (CA).** Firma certificados y establece la cadena de confianza."},"523":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/concepts/overview-6","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/concepts/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/pki/concepts/overview#el-modelo-en-cinco-piezas","content":"**Device Management Service (DMS).** Define cómo se registran, autentican y renuevan los dispositivos de una flota."},"524":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/concepts/overview-7","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/concepts/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/pki/concepts/overview#el-modelo-en-cinco-piezas","content":"**Dispositivo.** Conserva su clave privada y presenta el certificado para demostrar su identidad."},"525":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/concepts/overview-8","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/concepts/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/pki/concepts/overview#el-modelo-en-cinco-piezas","content":"**Validation Authority (VA).** Publica el estado de los certificados mediante OCSP y CRL."},"526":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/concepts/overview-9","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/concepts/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/pki/concepts/overview#del-alta-a-la-operación","content":"Un administrador configura un motor criptográfico y crea o importa una CA."},"527":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/concepts/overview-10","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/concepts/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/pki/concepts/overview#del-alta-a-la-operación","content":"Un DMS relaciona esa CA con una política de enrolamiento."},"528":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/concepts/overview-11","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/concepts/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/pki/concepts/overview#del-alta-a-la-operación","content":"El dispositivo genera una clave y solicita un certificado mediante EST, o un operador le asigna una identidad."},"529":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/concepts/overview-12","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/concepts/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/pki/concepts/overview#del-alta-a-la-operación","content":"Lamassu conserva el inventario, el historial y el estado de la identidad."},"530":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/concepts/overview-13","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/concepts/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/pki/concepts/overview#del-alta-a-la-operación","content":"Los consumidores comprueban la cadena y consultan OCSP o una CRL cuando necesitan conocer su vigencia."},"531":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/concepts/overview-14","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/concepts/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/pki/concepts/overview#del-alta-a-la-operación","content":"<Card title=\"Arquitectura\" description=\"Conoce los componentes y dónde termina la responsabilidad de cada uno.\" href=\"/docs/platform/pki/concepts/architecture\" />"},"532":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/concepts/overview-15","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/concepts/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/pki/concepts/overview#del-alta-a-la-operación","content":"<Card title=\"Ciclo de vida de una identidad\" description=\"Sigue un certificado desde el enrolamiento hasta la renovación o revocación.\" href=\"/docs/platform/pki/concepts/certificate-lifecycle\" />"},"533":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/crl","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/crl","type":"page","content":"Listas de revocación (CRL)","breadcrumbs":["Docs","Plataforma","Operar Lamassu"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/platform/pki/crl"},"534":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/crl-0","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/crl","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/pki/crl","content":"Genera y distribuye listas firmadas para validar certificados sin conexión."},"535":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/crl-1","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/crl","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/platform/pki/crl#servicio-crl","content":"Servicio CRL"},"536":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/crl-2","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/crl","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/platform/pki/crl#rol-va-y-configuración-por-ca","content":"Rol VA y configuración por CA"},"537":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/crl-3","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/crl","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/platform/pki/crl#regeneración-periódica-y-automática","content":"Regeneración periódica y automática"},"538":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/crl-4","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/crl","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/platform/pki/crl#contenido-de-la-crl","content":"Contenido de la CRL"},"539":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/crl-5","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/crl","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/platform/pki/crl#endpoint-público-de-descarga","content":"Endpoint público de descarga"},"540":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/crl-6","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/crl","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/platform/pki/crl#api-de-gestión-del-rol-va","content":"API de gestión del rol VA"},"541":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/crl-7","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/crl","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/platform/pki/crl#desde-la-interfaz","content":"Desde la interfaz"},"542":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/crl-8","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/crl","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/platform/pki/crl#referencias","content":"Referencias"},"543":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/crl-9","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/crl","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/pki/crl#servicio-crl","content":"Una CRL (*Certificate Revocation List*) es una lista firmada que contiene los números de serie de los certificados revocados antes de su fecha de caducidad. A diferencia de OCSP, no requiere una consulta en tiempo real: la parte que confía descarga la lista periódicamente y la consulta de forma local."},"544":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/crl-10","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/crl","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/pki/crl#servicio-crl","content":"Lamassu genera y mantiene una CRL por cada CA que gestiona. Cada CRL está firmada con la clave privada de la propia CA emisora y se almacena en el sistema de almacenamiento de objetos configurado en la plataforma."},"545":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/crl-11","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/crl","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/pki/crl#rol-va-y-configuración-por-ca","content":"La publicación de la CRL de cada CA se controla mediante un *rol VA*. Este objeto define cómo se genera, cuándo se regenera y qué clave se utiliza para firmarla."},"546":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/crl-12","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/crl","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/pki/crl#rol-va-y-configuración-por-ca","content":"Los parámetros principales son:"},"547":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/crl-13","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/crl","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/pki/crl#rol-va-y-configuración-por-ca","content":"**`validity`** define el periodo de validez reflejado en `nextUpdate`. Su valor predeterminado es 7 días."},"548":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/crl-14","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/crl","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/pki/crl#rol-va-y-configuración-por-ca","content":"**`refresh_interval`** establece el intervalo mínimo entre regeneraciones programadas. Por defecto es aproximadamente 6 días y 23 horas."},"549":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/crl-15","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/crl","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/pki/crl#rol-va-y-configuración-por-ca","content":"**`regenerate_on_revoke`** ordena publicar una versión nueva inmediatamente después de una revocación. Está activo por defecto."},"550":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/crl-16","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/crl","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/pki/crl#rol-va-y-configuración-por-ca","content":"El campo `subject_key_id_signer` identifica la CA cuya clave privada firma la CRL. Por defecto, cada CA firma su propia CRL."},"551":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/crl-17","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/crl","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/pki/crl#rol-va-y-configuración-por-ca","content":"Cada CRL lleva un número de versión incremental. Lamassu almacena todas las versiones en la ruta `pki/va/crl/{subject_key_id}/{version}.crl` del almacenamiento de objetos."},"552":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/crl-18","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/crl","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/pki/crl#regeneración-periódica-y-automática","content":"Un proceso en segundo plano supervisa los roles VA activos. Cuando la validez restante de la CRL vigente cae por debajo del período de vigilancia configurado (*blind period*), el sistema solicita la generación de una nueva CRL. Así se evita que la CRL publicada caduque sin que exista una versión válida disponible."},"553":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/crl-19","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/crl","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/pki/crl#regeneración-periódica-y-automática","content":"Además, cuando `regenerate_on_revoke` está activo, que es el comportamiento por defecto, cualquier revocación de un certificado desencadena inmediatamente la generación de una nueva CRL para la CA afectada. Esto reduce al mínimo el tiempo entre la revocación y su publicación."},"554":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/crl-20","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/crl","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/pki/crl#contenido-de-la-crl","content":"Cada entrada de la CRL incluye el número de serie del certificado revocado, la fecha de revocación y el código de razón conforme a RFC 5280."},"555":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/crl-21","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/crl","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/pki/crl#contenido-de-la-crl","content":"La CRL incluye también la extensión *Issuing Distribution Point* (IDP, OID 2.5.29.28), marcada como crítica, que indica la URL pública desde la que puede descargarse. Esa URL apunta al endpoint `/crl/{subject_key_id}` de cada dominio VA configurado."},"556":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/crl-22","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/crl","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/pki/crl#endpoint-público-de-descarga","content":"La CRL más reciente de una CA se puede obtener directamente sin autenticación:"},"557":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/crl-23","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/crl","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/pki/crl#endpoint-público-de-descarga","content":"La respuesta tiene `Content-Type: application/pkix-crl` y contiene la CRL en formato DER."},"558":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/crl-24","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/crl","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/pki/crl#api-de-gestión-del-rol-va","content":"El rol VA de una CA se puede consultar y actualizar mediante la API:"},"559":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/crl-25","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/crl","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/pki/crl#api-de-gestión-del-rol-va","content":"Método"},"560":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/crl-26","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/crl","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/pki/crl#api-de-gestión-del-rol-va","content":"Ruta"},"561":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/crl-27","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/crl","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/pki/crl#api-de-gestión-del-rol-va","content":"Descripción"},"562":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/crl-28","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/crl","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/pki/crl#api-de-gestión-del-rol-va","content":"`GET`"},"563":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/crl-29","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/crl","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/pki/crl#api-de-gestión-del-rol-va","content":"`/v1/roles/{ca-ski}`"},"564":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/crl-30","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/crl","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/pki/crl#api-de-gestión-del-rol-va","content":"Devuelve la configuración del rol VA y los metadatos de la última CRL emitida."},"565":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/crl-31","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/crl","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/pki/crl#api-de-gestión-del-rol-va","content":"`PUT`"},"566":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/crl-32","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/crl","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/pki/crl#api-de-gestión-del-rol-va","content":"`/v1/roles/{ca-ski}`"},"567":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/crl-33","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/crl","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/pki/crl#api-de-gestión-del-rol-va","content":"Actualiza los parámetros de la configuración del rol VA (`validity`, `refresh_interval`, `regenerate_on_revoke`)."},"568":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/crl-34","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/crl","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/pki/crl#api-de-gestión-del-rol-va","content":"Ejemplo de consulta del rol VA:"},"569":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/crl-35","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/crl","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/pki/crl#api-de-gestión-del-rol-va","content":"La respuesta incluye el campo `latest_crl` con la versión, la fecha de inicio de validez y la fecha de caducidad de la CRL actualmente publicada."},"570":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/crl-36","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/crl","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/pki/crl#desde-la-interfaz","content":"Desde el panel de detalle de una CA es posible previsualizar el contenido de la CRL activa y descargarla directamente para su uso offline o para importarla en aplicaciones que realicen validación local."},"571":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/crl-37","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/crl","tags":[],"t