docs/platform/pki/est-enrollment","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/pki/est-enrollment#notas-de-compatibilidad","content":"El cuerpo de `/cacerts`, `/simpleenroll` y `/simplereenroll` puede devolverse como PEM concatenado si el cliente envía `Accept: application/x-pem-file`. Esta es una extensión específica de Lamassu y no aparece en el RFC."},"896":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/est-enrollment-245","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/est-enrollment","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/pki/est-enrollment#notas-de-compatibilidad","content":"El servidor no rechaza explícitamente CSRs firmados con SHA-1 o MD5; el integrador debe generar el CSR con SHA-256 o superior."},"897":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/est-enrollment-246","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/est-enrollment","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/pki/est-enrollment#notas-de-compatibilidad","content":"<Card title=\"Visión general del DMS\" href=\"/docs/platform/pki/device-enrollment\" />"},"898":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/est-enrollment-247","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/est-enrollment","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/pki/est-enrollment#notas-de-compatibilidad","content":"<Card title=\"Validación OCSP\" href=\"/docs/platform/pki/ocsp\" />"},"899":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/est-enrollment-248","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/est-enrollment","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/pki/est-enrollment#notas-de-compatibilidad","content":"<Card title=\"Gestionar dispositivos\" href=\"/docs/platform/pki/device-management\" />"},"900":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/integrations/aws-iot-core","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/integrations/aws-iot-core","type":"page","content":"AWS IoT Core","breadcrumbs":["Docs","Plataforma","Integraciones"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/platform/pki/integrations/aws-iot-core"},"901":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/integrations/aws-iot-core-0","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/integrations/aws-iot-core","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/pki/integrations/aws-iot-core","content":"El conector de Lamassu para AWS IoT Core sincroniza las identidades de los dispositivos con la plataforma AWS, gestionando el registro de CAs, el aprovisionamiento de Things y el ciclo de vida de los certificados de forma automática y orientada a eventos."},"902":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/integrations/aws-iot-core-1","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/integrations/aws-iot-core","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/platform/pki/integrations/aws-iot-core#arquitectura-del-conector","content":"Arquitectura del conector"},"903":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/integrations/aws-iot-core-2","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/integrations/aws-iot-core","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/platform/pki/integrations/aws-iot-core#prerrequisitos","content":"Prerrequisitos"},"904":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/integrations/aws-iot-core-3","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/integrations/aws-iot-core","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/platform/pki/integrations/aws-iot-core#permisos-iam-necesarios","content":"Permisos IAM necesarios"},"905":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/integrations/aws-iot-core-4","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/integrations/aws-iot-core","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/platform/pki/integrations/aws-iot-core#parámetros-de-configuración","content":"Parámetros de configuración"},"906":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/integrations/aws-iot-core-5","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/integrations/aws-iot-core","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/platform/pki/integrations/aws-iot-core#registro-de-la-ca-en-aws-iot-core","content":"Registro de la CA en AWS IoT Core"},"907":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/integrations/aws-iot-core-6","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/integrations/aws-iot-core","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/platform/pki/integrations/aws-iot-core#cómo-solicitar-el-registro","content":"Cómo solicitar el registro"},"908":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/integrations/aws-iot-core-7","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/integrations/aws-iot-core","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/