4","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/key-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/pki/key-management#importar-un-par-existente","content":"Cuando se necesita migrar una PKI existente sin reemitir certificados."},"1154":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/key-management-65","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/key-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/pki/key-management#importar-un-par-existente","content":"Cuando Lamassu debe operar con una raíz de confianza creada por un tercero."},"1155":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/key-management-66","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/key-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/pki/key-management#importar-un-par-existente","content":"En el asistente, elija **Import Existing Key Pair** y complete los campos solicitados:"},"1156":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/key-management-67","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/key-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/pki/key-management#importar-un-par-existente","content":"**Key Name**: nombre descriptivo dentro de Lamassu IoT."},"1157":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/key-management-68","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/key-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/pki/key-management#importar-un-par-existente","content":"**Crypto Engine**: motor que custodiará la clave importada."},"1158":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/key-management-69","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/key-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/pki/key-management#importar-un-par-existente","content":"**Tags**: etiquetas para organización y búsqueda."},"1159":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/key-management-70","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/key-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/pki/key-management#importar-un-par-existente","content":"**Metadata**: información adicional opcional."},"1160":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/key-management-71","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/key-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/pki/key-management#importar-un-par-exi