: etiquetas asociadas."},"1168":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/key-management-79","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/key-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/pki/key-management#ver-detalles","content":"**Aliases**: nombres alternativos."},"1169":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/key-management-80","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/key-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/pki/key-management#ver-detalles","content":"**Crypto Engine**: motor en el que reside la clave."},"1170":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/key-management-81","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/key-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/pki/key-management#ver-detalles","content":"**Algorithm, Key Size & Strength**: algoritmo, parámetros y nivel de fortaleza."},"1171":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/key-management-82","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/key-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/pki/key-management#ver-detalles","content":"La sección **Related Entities** muestra qué objetos de Lamassu dependen de esa clave."},"1172":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/key-management-83","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/key-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/pki/key-management#ver-detalles","content":"La pestaña **Public Key** presenta la clave pública en formato PEM, lista para consulta o copia."},"1173":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/key-management-84","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/key-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/pki/key-management#firmar-y-verificar","content":"La acción **Sign / Verify** sirve para validar que la clave y el motor criptográfico funcionan correctamente."},"1174":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/key-management-85","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/key-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/pki/key-management#firmar-y-verificar","content":"Al abrirla aparecen dos áreas: **Sign** y **Verify**."},"1175":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/key-management-86","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/key-management","tags":[],"type":"tex