"text","url":"/docs/platform/pki/key-management#verify","content":"Campos principales:"},"1184":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/key-management-95","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/key-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/pki/key-management#verify","content":"**Algorithm**: debe coincidir con el algoritmo usado para la firma."},"1185":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/key-management-96","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/key-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/pki/key-management#verify","content":"**Message Type**: `Raw` o `Digest`."},"1186":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/key-management-97","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/key-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/pki/key-management#verify","content":"**Payload Encoding**: codificación del mensaje."},"1187":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/key-management-98","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/key-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/pki/key-management#verify","content":"**Message**: mensaje original o hash."},"1188":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/key-management-99","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/key-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/pki/key-management#verify","content":"**Signature**: firma que se desea comprobar."},"1189":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/key-management-100","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/key-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/pki/key-management#verify","content":"**Result**: indicador del resultado de la validación."},"1190":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/key-management-101","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/key-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/pki/key-management#generar-un-csr","content":"La acción **Generate CSR** crea una solicitud PKCS#10 firmada con la clave privada custodiada en Lamassu, sin exponerla fuera del motor criptográfico."},"1191":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/key-management-102","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/key-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/pki/key-management#generar-un-csr","content":"Este flujo es útil para:"},"1192":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/key-management-103","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/key-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/pki/key-management#generar-un-csr","content":"Solicitar certificados a una CA externa."},"1193":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/key-management-104","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/key-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/pki/key-management#generar-un-csr","content":"Renovar una identidad manteniendo la misma clave."},"1194":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/key-management-105","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/key-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/pki/key-management#generar-un-csr","content":"Al abrir el formulario se solicitan los datos del sujeto y los atributos principales del certificado:"},"1195":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/key-management-106","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/key-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/pki/key-management#generar-un-csr","content":"**Common Name (CN)**: nombre principal de la identidad."},"1196":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/key-management-107","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/key-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/pki/key-management#generar-un-csr","content":"**Organization (O)**: organización o empresa."},"1197":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/key-management-108","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/key-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/pki/key-management#generar-un-csr","content":"**Organizational Unit (OU)**: departamento o unidad."},"1198":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/key-management-109","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/key-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/pki/key-management#generar-un-csr","content":"**Country (C)**: código de país de dos letras."},"1199":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/key-management-110","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/key-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/pki/key-management#generar-un-csr","content":"**State / Province (ST)**: estado o provincia."},"1200":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/key-management-111","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/key-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/pki/key-management#generar-un-csr","content":"**Locality (L)**: ciudad o localidad."},"1201":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/key-management-112","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/key-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/pki/key-management#generar-un-csr","content":"**Email Address**: correo de contacto."},"1202":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/key-management-113","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/key-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/pki/key-management#generar-un-csr","content":"**Subject Alternative Names (SANs)**: nombres o identificadores alternativos, como DNS o IP."},"1203":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/key-management-114","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/key-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/pki/key-management#generar-un-csr","content":"Una vez completado el formulario, Lamassu genera la CSR y la presenta para su descarga o copia."},"1204":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/key-management-115","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/key-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/pki/key-management#firma-local-con-pkcs11","content":"Lamassu también ofrece una ayuda específica para integraciones locales mediante **Sign locally with OpenSSL & PKCS11 tools**."},"1205":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/key-management-116","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/key-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/pki/key-management#firma-local-con-pkcs11","content":"Esta opción muestra los pasos necesarios para configurar el entorno local, cargar el módulo PKCS#11 y ejecutar firmas con herramientas como OpenSSL sin extraer la clave privada del entorno custodiado."},"1206":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/ocsp","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/ocsp","type":"page","content":"Validación online con OCSP","breadcrumbs":["Docs","Plataforma","Operar Lamassu"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/platform/pki/ocsp"},"1207":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/ocsp-0","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/ocsp","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/pki/ocsp","content":"Consulta en tiempo real si un certificado sigue vigente o se ha revocado."},"1208":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/ocsp-1","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/ocsp","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/platform/pki/ocsp#servicio-ocsp","content":"Servicio OCSP"},"1209":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/ocsp-2","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/ocsp","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/platform/pki/ocsp#cómo-funciona-el-respondedor-en-lamassu","content":"Cómo funciona el respondedor en Lamassu"},"1210":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/ocsp-3","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/ocsp","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/platform/pki/ocsp#enlace-en-los-certificados-emitidos","content":"Enlace en los certificados emitidos"},"1211":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/ocsp-4","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/ocsp","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/platform/pki/ocsp#endpoints-http","content":"Endpoints HTTP"},"1212":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/ocsp-5","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/ocsp","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/platform/pki/ocsp#comprobación-desde-la-interfaz","content":"Comprobación desde la interfaz"},"1213":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/ocsp-6","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/ocsp","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/platform/pki/ocsp#referencias","content":"Referencias"},"1214":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/ocsp-7","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/ocsp","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/pki/ocsp#servicio-ocsp","content":"OCSP (Online Certificate Status Protocol) es el mecanismo que permite a una parte que confía comprobar, en tiempo real, si un certificado concreto está vigente o ha sido revocado. En lugar de descargar una lista completa de certificados revocados, el cliente envía una consulta con el número de serie del certificado y recibe una respuesta firmada con el estado actual."},"1215":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/ocsp-8","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/ocsp","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/pki/ocsp#servicio-ocsp","content":"Lamassu integra un respondedor OCSP propio que atiende estas consultas consultando directamente la base de datos interna de certificados. No se requiere ningún componente externo."},"1216":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/ocsp-9","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/ocsp","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/pki/ocsp#cómo-funciona-el-respondedor-en-lamassu","content":"Cuando un cliente solicita el estado de un certificado, el respondedor localiza el certificado por su número de serie y determina su estado según el registro interno:"},"1217":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/ocsp-10","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/ocsp","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/pki/ocsp#cómo-funciona-el-respondedor-en-lamassu","content":"Si el certificado está activo, la respuesta indica `Good`."},"1218":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/ocsp-11","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/ocsp","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/pki/ocsp#cómo-funciona-el-respondedor-en-lamassu","content":"Si el certificado ha sido revocado, la respuesta indica `Revoked` e incluye la marca de tiempo de revocación y el código de razón conforme a RFC 5280."},"1219":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/ocsp-12","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/ocsp","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/pki/ocsp#cómo-funciona-el-respondedor-en-lamassu","content":"Si el número de serie no se encuentra o el estado no es reconocible, la respuesta indica `Unknown`."},"1220":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/ocsp-13","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/ocsp","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/pki/ocsp#cómo-funciona-el-respondedor-en-lamassu","content":"La respuesta OCSP es firmada por la CA emisora del certificado consultado, utilizando el motor criptográfico asociado a esa CA. Lamassu no utiliza un certificado delegado de firma OCSP: la CA actúa directamente como respondedor."},"1221":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/ocsp-14","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/ocsp","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/pki/ocsp#cómo-funciona-el-respondedor-en-lamassu","content":"Cada respuesta tiene una ventana de validez de 24 horas, reflejada en los campos `thisUpdate` y `nextUpdate` de la respuesta. Los clientes que cacheen respuestas deben tener en cuenta esta ventana al determinar durante cuánto tiempo una respuesta sigue siendo válida."},"1222":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/ocsp-15","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/ocsp","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/pki/ocsp#enlace-en-los-certificados-emitidos","content":"La URL del respondedor OCSP se incorpora automáticamente en la extensión AIA (*Authority Information Access*) de todos los certificados emitidos por Lamassu. Los clientes que verifican certificados pueden leer esta URL directamente del certificado sin necesidad de configuración adicional."},"1223":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/ocsp-16","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/ocsp","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/pki/ocsp#endpoints-http","content":"El respondedor acepta los dos formatos definidos en RFC 6960:"},"1224":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/ocsp-17","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/ocsp","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/pki/ocsp#endpoints-http","content":"`GET /ocsp/{ocsp_request}` incluye la petición OCSP codificada en Base64url dentro de la propia URL."},"1225":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/ocsp-18","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/ocsp","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/pki/ocsp#endpoints-http","content":"`POST /ocsp` envía la petición en el cuerpo con `Content-Type: application/ocsp-request`."},"1226":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/ocsp-19","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/ocsp","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/pki/ocsp#endpoints-http","content":"Ejemplo de consulta con `curl` mediante POST:"},"1227":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/ocsp-20","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/ocsp","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/pki/ocsp#endpoints-http","content":"La respuesta tiene `Content-Type: application/ocsp-response` y contiene la respuesta OCSP en formato DER."},"1228":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/ocsp-21","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/ocsp","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/pki/ocsp#comprobación-desde-la-interfaz","content":"Desde la pantalla de certificados de Lamassu es posible lanzar una petición OCSP directamente sobre el certificado seleccionado mediante la acción **OCSP Check**. Esta acción muestra el estado devuelto por el respondedor sin necesidad de herramientas externas."},"1229":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/ocsp-22","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/ocsp","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/pki/ocsp#referencias","content":"RFC 6960 - *X.509 Internet Public Key Infrastructure Online Certificate Status Protocol – OCSP*"},"1230":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/ocsp-23","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/ocsp","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/pki/ocsp#referencias","content":"RFC 5280 - *Internet X.509 Public Key Infrastructure Certificate and Certificate Revocation List (CRL) Profile* (razones de revocación, sección 5.3.1)"},"1231":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/ocsp-24","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/ocsp","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/pki/ocsp#referencias","content":"<Card title=\"Servicio CRL\" href=\"/docs/platform/pki/crl\" />"},"1232":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/ocsp-25","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/ocsp","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/pki/ocsp#referencias","content":"<Card title=\"Validación de certificados\" href=\"/docs/platform/pki/certificate-validation\" />"},"1233":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/overview","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/overview","type":"page","content":"Plataforma Lamassu IoT","breadcrumbs":["Docs","Plataforma"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/platform/pki/overview"},"1234":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/overview-0","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/pki/overview","content":"Gestiona la PKI y las identidades digitales de tus dispositivos desde una única plataforma."},"1235":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/overview-1","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/overview","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/platform/pki/overview#empieza-aquí","content":"Empieza aquí"},"1236":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/overview-2","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/overview","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/platform/pki/overview#capacidades-principales","content":"Capacidades principales"},"1237":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/overview-3","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/overview","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/platform/pki/overview#construye-tu-jerarquía-de-confianza","content":"Construye tu jerarquía de confianza"},"1238":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/overview-4","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/overview","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/platform/pki/overview#protege-las-claves-criptográficas","content":"Protege las claves criptográficas"},"1239":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/overview-5","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/overview","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/platform/pki/overview#emite-y-controla-certificados","content":"Emite y controla certificados"},"1240":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/overview-6","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/overview","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/platform/pki/overview#automatiza-identidades-de-dispositivos","content":"Automatiza identidades de dispositivos"},"1241":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/overview-7","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/overview","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/platform/pki/overview#publica-el-estado-de-validación","content":"Publica el estado de validación"},"1242":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/overview-8","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/overview","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/platform/pki/overview#reacciona-a-los-eventos","content":"Reacciona a los eventos"},"1243":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/overview-9","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/overview","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/platform/pki/overview#elige-tu-recorrido","content":"Elige tu recorrido"},"1244":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/overview-10","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/pki/overview","content":"Lamassu IoT centraliza la emisión, distribución, renovación y revocación de identidades X.509 para dispositivos conectados. Puedes construir una PKI privada, proteger sus claves y automatizar el enrolamiento de una flota sin perder visibilidad sobre cada certificado."},"1245":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/overview-11","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/pki/overview#empieza-aquí","content":"<Card title=\"Primeros pasos\" description=\"Crea una CA, emite un certificado y registra tu primer dispositivo.\" href=\"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/overview\" />"},"1246":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/overview-12","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/pki/overview#empieza-aquí","content":"<Card title=\"Cómo funciona Lamassu\" description=\"Construye el modelo mental de autoridades, claves, identidades y validación.\" href=\"/docs/platform/pki/concepts/overview\" />"},"1247":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/overview-13","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/pki/overview#construye-tu-jerarquía-de-confianza","content":"Crea autoridades raíz e intermedias o importa una PKI existente. Define qué autoridad puede emitir cada identidad y conserva la cadena de confianza completa."},"1248":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/overview-14","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/pki/overview#protege-las-claves-criptográficas","content":"Genera y custodia claves mediante motores software, HSMs PKCS#11 o servicios cloud. Lamassu desacopla las operaciones de la ubicación física de la clave."},"1249":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/overview-15","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/pki/overview#emite-y-controla-certificados","content":"Emite certificados desde la consola o a partir de un CSR, consulta su estado y revócalos cuando dejan de ser fiables."},"1250":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/overview-16","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/pki/overview#automatiza-identidades-de-dispositivos","content":"Define políticas de enrolamiento mediante un Device Management Service (DMS) y deja que los dispositivos soliciten o renueven su identidad a través de EST."},"1251":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/overview-17","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/pki/overview#publica-el-estado-de-validación","content":"Ofrece validación online mediante OCSP y distribuye CRLs para consumidores que necesitan comprobar certificados sin conexión."},"1252":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/overview-18","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/pki/overview#reacciona-a-los-eventos","content":"Suscríbete a cambios del ciclo de vida y envía notificaciones por correo, Microsoft Teams o webhooks."},"1253":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/overview-19","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/pki/overview#elige-tu-recorrido","content":"<Card title=\"Administro la PKI\" description=\"Configura motores, autoridades, emisión y validación.\" href=\"/docs/platform/pki/key-management\" />"},"1254":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/overview-20","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/pki/overview#elige-tu-recorrido","content":"<Card title=\"Integro un dispositivo\" description=\"Configura el DMS y usa EST para obtener una identidad.\" href=\"/docs/platform/pki/device-enrollment\" />"},"1255":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/overview-21","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/pki/overview#elige-tu-recorrido","content":"<Card title=\"Opero la plataforma\" description=\"Despliega Lamassu y prepara sus dependencias.\" href=\"/docs/deployment/overview\" />"},"1256":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/overview-22","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/pki/overview#elige-tu-recorrido","content":"<Card title=\"Integro otro sistema\" description=\"Conecta Lamassu con AWS IoT Core y otros destinos.\" href=\"/docs/platform/pki/integrations/aws-iot-core\" />"},"1257":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority","type":"page","content":"Crea tu primera CA","breadcrumbs":["Docs","Plataforma","Primeros pasos"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority"},"1258":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority-0","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority","content":"Crea una autoridad raíz y comprueba que está preparada para emitir certificados."},"1259":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority-1","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority#antes-de-empezar","content":"Antes de empezar"},"1260":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority-2","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority#abre-el-asistente-de-creación","content":"Abre el asistente de creación"},"1261":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority-3","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority#selecciona-la-clave","content":"Selecciona la clave"},"1262":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority-4","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority#define-la-autoridad","content":"Define la autoridad"},"1263":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority-5","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority#revisa-y-crea-la-ca","content":"Revisa y crea la CA"},"1264":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority-6","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority#verifica-el-resultado","content":"Verifica el resultado"},"1265":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority-7","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority#siguiente-paso","content":"Siguiente paso"},"1266":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority-8","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority","content":"En este quickstart crearás una autoridad de certificación raíz con un nuevo par de claves. Al terminar tendrás una CA activa que podrás usar en el siguiente quickstart."},"1267":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority-9","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority#antes-de-empezar","content":"Acceso a la consola con permisos para gestionar autoridades."},"1268":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority-10","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority#antes-de-empezar","content":"Al menos un motor criptográfico disponible."},"1269":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority-11","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority#antes-de-empezar","content":"Un nombre que identifique el propósito de la CA, por ejemplo `Acme Device Root CA`."},"1270":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority-12","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority#antes-de-empezar","content":"Una CA raíz se autofirma y actúa como ancla de confianza. Para producción suele ser preferible mantener la raíz más protegida y emitir desde una CA intermedia."},"1271":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority-13","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority#abre-el-asistente-de-creación","content":"En el menú lateral, abre **Certification Authorities** y selecciona **Create New CA**."},"1272":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority-14","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority#abre-el-asistente-de-creación","content":"Elige crear una CA con un par de claves nuevo. Si ya tienes la clave en el KMS, usa &#x2A;*Create New CA (Existing Key)**."},"1273":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority-15","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority#selecciona-la-clave","content":"Elige el motor criptográfico que custodiará la clave y configura el algoritmo. Para una primera CA puedes usar **EC P-384**, siempre que sea compatible con tus consumidores."},"1274":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority-16","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority#selecciona-la-clave","content":"La clave privada permanecerá bajo el control del motor seleccionado."},"1275":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority-17","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority#define-la-autoridad","content":"Selecciona **Root CA** y completa:"},"1276":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority-18","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority#define-la-autoridad","content":"**CA Name**: un nombre único y reconocible."},"1277":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority-19","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority#define-la-autoridad","content":"**Subject**: al menos la organización y el país que identificarán a la autoridad."},"1278":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority-20","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority#define-la-autoridad","content":"**CA Certificate Expiration**: una validez mayor que la de los certificados que emitirá."},"1279":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority-21","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority#define-la-autoridad","content":"**Default End-Entity Certificate Issuance Expiration**: la validez predeterminada de los certificados finales."},"1280":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority-22","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority#define-la-autoridad","content":"El nombre de la CA se utilizará como `Common Name` del certificado."},"1281":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority-23","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority#revisa-y-crea-la-ca","content":"Comprueba el algoritmo, el sujeto y las fechas antes de confirmar. Estos valores definen el ancla de confianza y no deberían elegirse como simples datos de prueba en un entorno productivo."},"1282":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority-24","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority#verifica-el-resultado","content":"Abre la nueva CA desde el listado. Debe aparecer activa y mostrar su certificado PEM, la fecha de expiración y la pestaña **Issued Certificates**."},"1283":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority-25","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority#siguiente-paso","content":"Usa la autoridad para emitir tu primer certificado, o consulta la guía completa de autoridades para crear una CA intermedia, importar una CA o definir perfiles avanzados."},"1284":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate","type":"page","content":"Emite tu primer certificado","breadcrumbs":["Docs","Plataforma","Primeros pasos"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate"},"1285":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate-0","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate","content":"Emite una identidad X.509 desde la consola y verifica el resultado."},"1286":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate-1","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate#antes-de-empezar","content":"Antes de empezar"},"1287":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate-2","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate#inicia-la-emisión","content":"Inicia la emisión"},"1288":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate-3","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate#elige-el-método","content":"Elige el método"},"1289":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate-4","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate#identifica-el-certificado","content":"Identifica el certificado"},"1290":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate-5","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate#configura-clave-y-usos","content":"Configura clave y usos"},"1291":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate-6","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate#emite-y-descarga","content":"Emite y descarga"},"1292":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate-7","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate#verifica-el-resultado","content":"Verifica el resultado"},"1293":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate-8","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate#siguiente-paso","content":"Siguiente paso"},"1294":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate-9","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate","content":"En este quickstart Lamassu generará la clave y el CSR en el navegador, y la CA emitirá el certificado. Al terminar descargarás el certificado y su clave privada."},"1295":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate-10","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate#antes-de-empezar","content":"Una CA activa con permiso para emitir certificados."},"1296":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate-11","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate#antes-de-empezar","content":"Un nombre para la identidad, por ejemplo `device-001.example.internal`."},"1297":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate-12","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate#antes-de-empezar","content":"Un lugar seguro en el que custodiar la clave privada descargada."},"1298":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate-13","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate#antes-de-empezar","content":"En este flujo la clave se genera en el navegador y Lamassu no la almacena. Descárgala y protégela antes de cerrar el resultado de la operación."},"1299":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate-14","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate#inicia-la-emisión","content":"Abre la CA creada en el quickstart anterior, entra en **Issued Certificates** y selecciona **Issue New**."},"1300":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate-15","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate#elige-el-método","content":"Selecciona **Generate Key & CSR in Browser**. Usa **Upload Existing CSR** cuando la clave privada deba generarse y permanecer en el sistema de destino."},"1301":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate-16","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate#identifica-el-certificado","content":"Introduce el `Common Name` y, si corresponde, la organización, unidad organizativa y ubicación. Añade SANs para cada nombre DNS, dirección IP, correo o URI con el que se vaya a validar la identidad."},"1302":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate-17","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate#configura-clave-y-usos","content":"Elige RSA o ECDSA, define la validez y selecciona los usos de clave. Para una identidad de dispositivo que usa mTLS, habilita **Digital Signature** y **Client Authentication**."},"1303":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate-18","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate#configura-clave-y-usos","content":"La validez no puede superar la fecha de expiración de la CA emisora."},"1304":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate-19","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate#emite-y-descarga","content":"Confirma la emisión y descarga inmediatamente el certificado y la clave privada en formato PEM."},"1305":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate-20","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate#verifica-el-resultado","content":"El certificado debe aparecer en **Issued Certificates** con estado activo. Comprueba su sujeto, SANs, emisor, usos y periodo de validez."},"1306":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate-21","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate#siguiente-paso","content":"Registra tu primer dispositivo para asociar la identidad a una entidad gestionada, o consulta la gestión de certificados."},"1307":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/overview","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/overview","type":"page","content":"Primeros pasos","breadcrumbs":["Docs","Plataforma","Primeros pasos"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/overview"},"1308":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/overview-0","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/overview","content":"Obtén un primer resultado con Lamassu y continúa desde una base funcional."},"1309":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/overview-1","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/overview","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/overview#ruta-recomendada","content":"Ruta recomendada"},"1310":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/overview-2","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/overview","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/overview#antes-de-empezar","content":"Antes de empezar"},"1311":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/overview-3","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/overview","content":"Los quickstarts te llevan desde una instancia preparada hasta una identidad de dispositivo activa. Cada guía produce un resultado verificable y enlaza la explicación detallada cuando necesitas ir más allá."},"1312":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/overview-4","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/overview#ruta-recomendada","content":"<Card title=\"1. Crea tu primera CA\" description=\"Establece una raíz de confianza capaz de emitir certificados.\" href=\"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority\" />"},"1313":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/overview-5","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/overview#ruta-recomendada","content":"<Card title=\"2. Emite un certificado\" description=\"Crea una identidad X.509 y verifica su contenido.\" href=\"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate\" />"},"1314":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/overview-6","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/overview#ruta-recomendada","content":"<Card title=\"3. Registra un dispositivo\" description=\"Añade un dispositivo y asígnale su primera identidad.\" href=\"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/register-device\" />"},"1315":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/overview-7","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/overview#antes-de-empezar","content":"Necesitas acceso a la consola de Lamassu IoT y permisos para administrar claves, autoridades y dispositivos. La instancia debe tener al menos un motor criptográfico configurado."},"1316":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/overview-8","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/overview#antes-de-empezar","content":"Si todavía no tienes una instancia, elige primero un modelo de despliegue."},"1317":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/register-device","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/register-device","type":"page","content":"Registra tu primer dispositivo","breadcrumbs":["Docs","Plataforma","Primeros pasos"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/register-device"},"1318":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/register-device-0","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/register-device","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/register-device","content":"Añade un dispositivo a Lamassu y asígnale una identidad activa."},"1319":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/register-device-1","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/register-device","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/register-device#antes-de-empezar","content":"Antes de empezar"},"1320":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/register-device-2","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/register-device","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/register-device#registra-el-dispositivo","content":"Registra el dispositivo"},"1321":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/register-device-3","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/register-device","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/register-device#comprueba-el-estado-inicial","content":"Comprueba el estado inicial"},"1322":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/register-device-4","page_id":"/docs/p